      "role": "user",
      "content": "those archetypes are a good start, but they're a bit generic. i want to make sure the world feels authentic and grounded in the reality of the city's different neighborhoods. to make the contrast work, i need these underworld characters to feel like they belong to those specific, rougher parts of town that the detective just doesn't inhabit. can you add some more specific details to these characters? maybe include their background, ethnicity, or specific cultural vibes to help me visualize where they come from and why they're so different from the lead guy?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
